<title>INDIA: WSC-India and Pakistan Wheat Weather, Sept 23.</title>
<headline>WSC-India and Pakistan Wheat Weather, Sept 23.</headline>
<text>
<p>SUMMARY- Dry. Highs 88-100F (31-38C).</p>
<p>CROP IMPACT- Planting for winter wheat begins in October.</p>
<p>FORECAST-</p>
<p>TODAY...Sunny and dry. Highs 88-100F (31-38C).</p>
<p>TONIGHT...Clear. Lows 68-77F (20-25C).</p>
<p>TOMORROW...Sunny. Highs again 88-100F (31-38C).</p>
<p>OUTLOOK...Generally fair and warm Wednesday-Friday.</p>
<p>Source: Weather Services Corporation</p>
</text>
